  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&#x2019;s Integrated Sexual Health 2 (DIVIDENDS): Planned Parenthood Association of Zambia (PPAZ) (Zambia)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Planned Parenthood Association of Zambia (PPAZ), the IPPF Member Association in Zambia, is a locally owned Non-Governmental Organization providing quality integrated SRHR information, products and services. In the WISH2ACTION project, the organization gives priority to underserved women and girls including but not limited to youth under the age of 20, those living in poverty, and those living in disability.</narrative>
  </description>
